    <guid isPermaLink="false">6743502911045e78e58f8094</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Nov 2024 19:55:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>📖 本期简介</span></h2><span></span><p><span>豆瓣开分9.1，《好东西》究竟有什么魔力，让我们先睹为快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>提示，本期节目含大量剧透，介意的小伙伴可以先收藏，看完电影再来收听哦 ღ( ´･ᴗ･` )比心</span></p><span></span><h2><span>⏰ 时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>&nbsp;分享热映电影《好东西》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a>&nbsp;温暖动人的女性友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>&nbsp;月经羞耻：可是全世界有一半的人都会流血呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a>&nbsp;男生也会受到月经羞耻的影响吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a>&nbsp;开会时上厕所的心理负担</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1684">28:04</a>&nbsp;爸爸们，请停止比烂好吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a>&nbsp;好的爱情观从满足自我需求出发，对自己负责，不一定非要断情绝爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a>&nbsp;正直勇敢的价值观和追求自我兴趣的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2493">41:33</a>&nbsp;功利主义视角下的爱好，只是攀比的奖章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a>&nbsp;浪漫诠释生活日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3054">50:54</a>&nbsp;宋佳真的是很优秀的演员！</span></p>]]></description>
