  <item>
    <title>13. 独立与责任 | 自由生活的双重面孔</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673ffc2011045e78e5fe1793</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673ffc2011045e78e5fe1793</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Nov 2024 07:03:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>📖 本期简介</span></h2><span></span><p><span>自由很酷，但现实世界中“选择权”的拥有往往离不开经济基础。良好的个人财务状况，意味着拥独立生活的物质条件：吃饱穿暖，遮风避雨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由很美，但每次选择都需要自己承担结果。这是一场又一场关乎勇气、智慧、责任的游戏，谁决策，谁负责，无论好坏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到现实世界。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>⏰ 时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 全职儿女可能失去了一些自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="562">09:22</a> 无法负担但又想买的电视机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 回到“正轨”，真的状态更好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> 女性同样要经济独立！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 我的装修我做主，糟心事也自己扛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2029">33:49</a> 人生大事——婚姻，头脑清醒地自己选</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpHhVyTsypHW2rE-sN80KXcOGwGg.m4a" length="39806951" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:01</itunes:duration>
