  <item>
    <title>11. 那些说不出口的羞耻瞬间｜别让羞耻感绑架我们的生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d9ad05ee04007d8868c39c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d9ad05ee04007d8868c39c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 13:07:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>📖 本期简介</span></h2><span></span><p><span>羞耻感作为一种复杂的情感体验，在不同文化和个体之间呈现出多样的表现和影响，深刻影响我们的情绪感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们聊聊各种经历过的羞耻时刻，回头看既感慨又有趣。有些羞耻已经不在，有些羞耻还在“斗争”，但说出来就已帮助我们变得更勇敢和放松。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>⏰ 时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 今天是超害羞的开主播开场哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 小朋友也有羞耻感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 骨折上班就很羞耻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 和同班同学谈恋爱也很羞耻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> 友谊里的羞耻瞬间：我们还是好朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1369">22:49</a> “努力”羞耻：什么时候起，努力竟成了会被嘲笑的事情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a> 职场牛马：每一份努力都必须被看见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a> 性别羞耻的过度教育与消失的性教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 我们如何面对自己的羞耻感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a> 探索自我与勇敢尝试：你你你你，你要跳舞吗？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp1pDPw000dPsvHRJnTfaPvjU9H0.m4a" length="42557897" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:51</itunes:duration>
